 "posts": [
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 8, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 8, 2026 (Thursday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 8, 2026 (Thursday)\nReason: \n● Replacement of porcelain insulators into High-Density Polyethylene insulators;\n● Installation of fuse cut out covers, distribution tansformer bushing covers & bail clamps; and\n● Rerouting of secondary line\nTime & Affected Areas:\n9:00AM to 4:00PM\nPortion of LF2 - Portion of Villa Hergon, Brgy. Rizal, Silay City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
